  "text": [
    "Our aim is to gather preliminary assessment knowledge of a vaccine-centric CA to help refine our idea of utilizing an automated CA for HPV counseling at a clinical environment.",
    "For our early assessment and data collection process, we employed the Wizard of OZ protocol that simulates speech interfaces with a potential user who thinks they are interacting with an automated machine or robot  .",
    "It allows us the evaluate the usability and acceptability of the system rather than to measure the quality of an entire system."
  ],
